  n = 11 journals. Six of them share policy level 3, so the number of
  DISTINCT rank arrangements is far below 11!; the Monte-Carlo p above
  is over that reduced set and 0.026 is not far from its floor. Treat
  this as one observation with a consistent direction, not a rate.

